## Language, in Orbito's settings (Appearance)

orbito-language-title = Language
orbito-language-hint = The language of Orbito and Firefox's menus and pages. Firefox's language pack is downloaded with it.
orbito-language-restart = Restart to apply
# $language is the language's own name, e.g. "한국어".
orbito-language-pending = { $language } will be used after a restart.
orbito-language-no-langpack = Firefox's language pack couldn't be downloaded, so some of Firefox's menus and pages stay in English.
